  "name": "Zul'Gurub: High Priestess Mar'li Evolves a spawn on Mythic, never herself (#8075), and not on Normal",
  "contract": [
    "Evolve (2118116) evolves a target spider egg: it heals its target to full health (effect 67) and applies a",
    "+200% scale aura. Mar'li (14510) casts it 22 s into the troll phase on a Spawn of Mar'li (15041) she hatches",
    "from the nearest free egg (179985), never on herself, so she neither carries the Evolve aura nor heals to full",
    "health. Evolve belongs to Mythic and Ascended only (round-5 tester: the Mythic and Ascended mechanics), so a",
    "Normal Mar'li never casts it. A Normal and a Mythic hero each fight one Mar'li alone. The world's eggs share",
    "phase 1 and the fixture lives in the lane's own phase, so each hero places eleven untimed eggs right after the",
    "pull (eggs on a hero before it keep Mar'li from engaging): Hatch Eggs at 17 s claims ten of them and hatches",
    "them 10 s later, which leaves Evolve one free egg whichever of the two comes first. The Normal hero therefore",
    "sees ten spawns, the eleventh egg unclaimed."
  ],
